.sound"],"query":"RankerSourceSemantics.source_dot_literal_eq","report_occurrences":2},{"axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"],"query":"RankerSourceSemantics.supported_update_eq","report_occurrences":2},{"axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"],"query":"RankerSourceSemantics.source_update_literal_eq","report_occurrences":2},{"axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"],"query":"RankerSourceSemantics.originalRealStep_update_join","report_occurrences":2}],"future_import_requirement":"Exact actual check/source/object/ordered-chunks/environment join and explicit historical-policy compatibility. Some older support queries have1report; this plan does not silently label them2report qualified. Fresh native batches remain2reports/query.","historical_accepted_native_check":{"bytes":19104,"path":"/home/barberb/lift_coding/qualification/codebase_ir/ranker-source-semantics-20261005-01/evidence/lean-typed-scalar-02/check-result.json","sha256":"1e11d2917e3087dc2e231bdf6b329416518eb74542d6e83074d000ee7f8a0e23"},"module":"TypedNumericSlice","reuse":["source_update_literal_eq","originalRealStep_update_join"],"source":{"bytes":11197,"path":"/home/barberb/lift_coding/qualification/codebase_ir/ranker-source-semantics-20261005-01/preparation/lean-typed-scalar-02-producer/TypedNumericSlice.lean","sha256":"bd65d5d0c5ba08dfe4523db151ac5e6075d5abb2f54b26e8007b0926b82f335d"},"whole_object":{"bytes":939920,"path":"/home/barberb/lift_coding/qualification/codebase_ir/ranker-source-semantics-20261005-01/evidence/lean-typed-scalar-02/lean/TypedNumericSlice.olean","sha256":"d666b11adfa7d878e2745c2ebdec1c7caf523bd82e0d7a702e99741376209465"}}],"schema":"ranker-objective-source-model-evaluation-plan@1","stages":[{"contract":"Define named aliases for actual RHS/body literals; prove the entire emittedPrefix equals that five-let/record decomposition by kernel structural equality. Prove scalar aliases equal deterministic injections of original loss/factor SourceScalar literals. These source equalities are proved, never supplied as semantic premises.","inputs":["actual generated emittedPrefix plus same-buffer source/AST/IR/decoder/emitter/compiler/materialization pins","all five ordered RHS literal digests and original emitted loss/factor scalar literals"],"name":"SourceSyntaxParts","queries":["emitted_prefix_decomposition","emitted_loss_body_scalar_injection","emitted_factor_body_scalar_injection"],"status":"UNIMPLEMENTED_UNCOMPILED_UNQUALIFIED"},{"contract":"For every scalar source term, new named evaluation of its injection equals old evalSourceExact under scalar-name projection. Derive actual stable loss/factor success from primitive z binding. Prove log1p domain and positive exp denominators; preserve lazy branch behavior and both-syntax compilation. No desired objective or gradient premise.","inputs":["structural SourceScalar -> SourceExpr injection with typed literal/var leaves and recursive scalar forms","NamedEnvironment scalar projection envScalar(name)=env(name,Ty.scalar)","qualified original scalar source semantics"],"name":"SourceScalarLift","queries":["eval_lift_scalar_source","named_stable_loss_success","named_stable_factor_success"],"status":"UNIMPLEMENTED_UNCOMPILED_UNQUALIFIED"},{"contract":"Lift primitive success through independent source constructors. Zip retains Fin(min lengths), existing paired coordinates, explicit input embeddings and right::left environments. Range evaluates bound vector before indices, even at0. Derive length/index/coercion/let/record helpers directly from source evaluator definitions.","inputs":["qualified mapToVector_ofFn_success, zipToVector_ofFn_min_success and orderedFsum_ofFn_eq_sum","actual source input success and primitive body success at actual coordinates"],"name":"SourceContainerSuccess","queries":["eval_source_mapRows_success","eval_source_mapVector_success","eval_source_zipMap_min_success","eval_source_zipRowsMap_min_success","eval_source_rangeMap_success","eval_source_fsum_success"],"status":"UNIMPLEMENTED_UNCOMPILED_UNQUALIFIED"},{"contract":"Define generic typed readRecord by Slot/RecordValues recursion; project Except outputs through mapOne. Use exact typed field position/schema rather than unchecked names, dimensions or default values.","inputs":["qualified RecordValues Schema and existing Slot Schema Ty","actual schema margins Vecn/data scalar/regularizer scalar/factors Vecn/gradient Vecm"],"name":"PrefixRecordProjection","queries":["record_read_cons_here","record_read_cons_there","prefix_record_projection_success"],"status":"UNIMPLEMENTED_UNCOMPILED_UNQUALIFIED"},{"contract":"Evaluate the actual fixed4x80 RHS graph under arbitrary typed weights/differences, extending the environment by each previously derived value, then assemble the exact complete ordered record. Identify data+regularizer with realObjective lambdaSource differences weights and actual computed gradient with realCoordinateGradient lambdaSource differences weights via qualified stable-body equalities and exact algebra. No desired evaluation/gradient/descent/convergence premise. Generic n/m traversal helpers are instantiated here; any generalized source-pattern family requires a separate structural equality at n4/m80/source coefficient to the actual generated prefix.","derived_values":{"data":"(sum i:Fin4, realStablePairLoss(dot weights (differences i)))/4","factors":"fun i:Fin4 => realStableLogisticP(dot weights (differences i))","gradient":"fun j:Fin80 => lambdaSource*weights j-(sum i:Fin4, realStableLogisticP(dot weights (differences i))*differences i j)/4","margins":"fun i:Fin4 => dot weights (differences i)","regularizer":"lambdaSource*(sum j:Fin80, weights j*weights j)/2"},"inputs":["actual whole-prefix decomposition and actual body aliases","arbitrary weights:Fin80->Real and differences:Fin4->Fin80->Real; closed positive-row fact0<4","fixed lambdaSource=((5764607523034235:Rat)/576460752303423488:Real)","qualified generic scalar/traversal/record helpers and independently defined mathematical objective/gradient with implicit n4/m80"],"name":"ActualEmittedPrefixEvaluation","queries":["emitted_margins_eval_success","emitted_data_eval_success","emitted_regularizer_eval_success","emitted_factors_eval_success","emitted_gradient_eval_success","emitted_prefix_eval_success","emitted_numeric_objective_projection_eq","emitted_gradient_projection_eq"],"split_modules":["MarginsEvaluation","LossRegularizerEvaluation","FactorsGradientEvaluation","PrefixEvaluation"],"status":"UNIMPLEMENTED_UNCOMPILED_UNQUALIFIED","zero_row_obligation":"Separate generic source-pattern/control theorem: admitted empty vectors/matrix produce empty margins then divisionByZero at data and stop later lets. The actual generated4-row literal cannot be assigned a zero-row input without a type mismatch."},{"contract":"Instantiate source environment with fixed originalRealDifferences and prove source coefficient equals stored Rat mu. This establishes mathematical source-environment projections. Python _prepare correspondence remains open.","inputs":["proved actual fixed4x80 source-prefix evaluation","fixed exact source coefficient ratio","qualified originalRealDifferences, originalRealMu and originalRealEta","arbitrary weights Fin80 -> Real"],"name":"OriginalPrefixModelJoin","queries":["source_L2_eq_originalRealMu","original_source_prefix_eval_success","original_source_numeric_objective_eq","original_source_computed_gradient_eq"],"status":"UNIMPLEMENTED_UNCOMPILED_UNQUALIFIED"},{"contract":"Define partial step through actual prefix evaluation, typed computed-gradient projection, then actual scalar/list source update. Prove source step succeeds and equals realGradientStep; substitute derived theorem into existing descent. Never accept supplied mathematical gradient or desired descent as a premise.","inputs":["actual computed gradient projection theorem","actual qualified source update literal/source_update_literal_eq","originalRealEta and originalReal_safe_descent"],"name":"ComputedSourceStepDescent","queries":["computed_source_step_success","computed_source_step_eq_original_model","computed_source_safe_descent"],"status":"UNIMPLEMENTED_UNCOMPILED_UNQUALIFIED"},{"contract":"Prove source partial iteration success/model recurrence equality by induction. Prove epochs1..128, epochs+1 observations and epochs updates. Only separately named infinite exact-real extension can reuse mathematical convergence. Finite binary64 training/global autoencoder convergence do not follow.","inputs":["proved actual computed source step","actual zero initialization/epoch observation/update source conditions","qualified originalReal_model_converges"],"name":"FiniteSourceControlAndRealExtension","queries":["computed_source_iterate_success","computed_source_iterate_eq_originalRealIterate","original_finite_epoch_trace_alignment","computed_source_real_extension_converges"],"status":"UNIMPLEMENTED_UNCOMPILED_UNQUALIFIED"}],"staging":"Split small modules below3997696B complete objects. Preserve every executed source/failed attempt and require exact source/query/environment/ownedlease/chunk gates.","status":"SOURCE_FILE_ONLY_NEW_THEOREMS_UNIMPLEMENTED_UNCOMPILED_UNQUALIFIED"}
